					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2174701#post-2772545</guid>
				<title>Whats The Point Of Making A Bunch Of Plot Threads If You Can&#039;t Just Tie Them All Off At Once?</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2174701/the-blackbird-and-the-falcon#post-2772545</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 21 Mar 2017 19:16:49 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Jacob Conwell</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1372582</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>When I wrote the first version of SCP-1360 way back in 2012 I had no idea it would spark a plot arc that spanned over 21 tales and articles, and spawn a new Group of Interest. Writing the Anderson Robotics tales and skips that I have, has shaped me as a writer and has allowed me to leave my mark, however minor, on this fine community.</p> <p>That all being said, time to wind things down a bit. I consider this to be the official finale of my AR plot arc. All my characters, from Vincent Anderson, to Sasha Merlo, to Agent Shaw, to Director Holman, and even Researcher Conwell, are where I want them to be, and it is better to go out on a bang than limp along until the steam runs out.</p> <p>That is not to say that this marks the complete and total end of the AR story. There are plenty of tales/articles to be told before the Foundation raid, and with Dr. Contos, the Sakers, and Mr. Dillard still on the lamb, there are plenty of tales to tell afterwards.</p> <p>Thank you to everyone who helped go over this as a draft:<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Taffeta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" >Taffeta</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1814684&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="GreenWolf" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1814684)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" >GreenWolf</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tygently" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2038009&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="TyGently" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2038009)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tygently" >TyGently</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Roget" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" >Roget</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirens" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2802387&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Sirens" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2802387)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirens" >Sirens</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/randomini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1379080&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Randomini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1379080)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/randomini" >Randomini</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2303803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Cyantreuse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2303803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" >Cyantreuse</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=560062&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="minmin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=560062)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" >minmin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crayne" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1346995&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Crayne" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1346995)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crayne" >Crayne</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2005044&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Decibelles" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2005044)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" >Decibelles</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mf99k" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2184508&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Mf99k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2184508)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mf99k" >Mf99k</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lex1nat0r" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2172650&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Lex1nat0r" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2172650)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lex1nat0r" >Lex1nat0r</a></span></p> <p>Extra special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Taffeta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" >Taffeta</a></span> for suggesting the name &quot;Operation Falcon Punch.&quot;</p> <p>Double extra special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1814684&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="GreenWolf" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1814684)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" >GreenWolf</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2005044&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Decibelles" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2005044)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" >Decibelles</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crayne" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1346995&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="Crayne" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1346995)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crayne" >Crayne</a></span> for use of their characters, Agents Spencer and Thorne, Researcher Labelle, and Dr. Aeslinger, respectively.</p> <p>Triple extra special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1504054031" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span>, for allowing me to use their code for the SCPF stationary, and newspaper formatting, respectively.</p> <p>For those of you wondering about the title, my sources indicate that the surname Merlo originated from Italian and medieval Spanish words for blackbird. Considering the back and forth relationship between Merlo and the Falcon obsessed Anderson, the title fit.</p> <p>For those of you who have been along for the ride since day one, I hope you find this to be a suitable finale. For those of you just getting here, I hope you find this to be a nice tale in its own right.</p> <p>Enjoy the tale. Hopefully I'm not shooting myself in the foot too heavily by releasing this so close to 3000Con.</p> <p><em>JC</em></p> 
